--[[
    KRONOS CHAT - SERVER CHAT HEAD BUBBLES ADDON
    ==============================================

    FEATURES:
      • Displays server-chat messages above the sender's head
      • Displays YOUR OWN messages as well
      • Only displays players currently inside this Roblox server
      • Glassmorphic Roblox-chat-style bubbles
      • Bright red -> black animated borders
      • Custom Unicode text styling
      • Each bubble lasts 7 seconds
      • Smooth fade-out
      • Multiple messages stack like Roblox chat
      • Newest message appears at the bottom
      • Older messages move upward
      • Maximum 4 visible bubbles per player
      • Respawn-safe
      • Standalone addon
]]

